      "s": "makemeahanzi",
      "t": "Grains of sand; 小 provides the pronunciation and meaning"
    },
    {
      "s": "dong_chinese",
      "t": "Pictograph of four small dots, representing grains of sand or rice, to convey the meaning \"less\". Similar to 小."
    },
    {
      "s": "shuowen_jiezi",
      "t": "不多也。从小丿聲。",
      "w": 1
    },
    {
      "s": "wiktionary",
      "t": "Pictogram (象形) – four dots, perhaps three grains of sand (see 沙), to indicate \"a few, a little\". Phonetically borrowed from 小 (OC *smewʔ, “small”), which is depicted by three dots.\nUnrelated to 步 (and hence 歲), in which the lower component is the stylization of a foot."
    }
  ],
